491
01:26:12.434 --> 01:26:20.434
Hallelujah, you were redeemed with the precious blood of Christ, the perfect lamb of sacrifice.

492
01:26:21.434 --> 01:26:23.434
All glory to Him.

493
01:26:23.434 --> 01:26:27.434
He was there before the world was made.

494
01:26:27.434 --> 01:26:30.434
Be careful, okay. He was there before the world was made.

495
01:26:30.434 --> 01:26:34.434
But only now, at the end of time, has He come for us.

496
01:26:34.434 --> 01:26:38.434
God raised Him from the dead and made Him alive again.

497
01:26:38.434 --> 01:26:43.434
