498
01:26:43.434 --> 01:26:48.434
He wanted you to trust completely in God through Jesus.

499
01:26:48.434 --> 01:26:49.434
Verse 22.

500
01:26:49.434 --> 01:26:53.434
Through the Holy Spirit you have become obedient to the truth of God.

501
01:26:53.434 --> 01:26:58.434
Now your inner being is completely clean.

502
01:26:58.434 --> 01:27:01.434
That is the ingredient of cleansing.

503
01:27:01.434 --> 01:27:08.434
So through the Holy Spirit, for we need to read this sentence once more to learn a bit more about it.

504
01:27:08.434 --> 01:27:12.434
