505
01:27:12.434 --> 01:27:17.434
So through the Holy Spirit, you have become obedient to the truth of God.

506
01:27:17.434 --> 01:27:27.434
The Holy Spirit, namely, is the third person of the Trinity given to us so that ultimately, as the prophets already said in the Old Testament,

507
01:27:27.434 --> 01:27:35.434
there will come a time when it is no longer a law on stone tablets that must be imposed upon you, for otherwise something will swing.

508
01:27:35.434 --> 01:27:39.434
That is no longer the law of God in the way God wants to communicate it.

509
01:27:39.434 --> 01:27:49.434
He wants His laws, the same laws, instead of being imposed, He wants those same laws to be engraved in your heart by the Holy Spirit.

510
01:27:49.434 --> 01:27:56.434
For when it is engraved in your heart, it is not engraved on a piece of stone.

511
01:27:56.434 --> 01:28:02.434
For that piece of stone is external to you, but in your heart is internal.

512
01:28:02.434 --> 01:28:05.434
A desire, etched in your heart.

513
01:28:05.434 --> 01:28:10.434
So that when you want to sin, your heart begins to groan.

514
01:28:10.434 --> 01:28:12.434
That your heart says, no, I don't want that anymore.

515
01:28:12.434 --> 01:28:14.434
And your flesh says, yes, but I still want that.

516
01:28:14.434 --> 01:28:17.434
And your heart says, no, I don't want that anymore, I want to belong to Jesus.

517
01:28:17.434 --> 01:28:20.434
And your flesh says, yes, but I am very angry about it.

518
01:28:20.434 --> 01:28:23.434
And your flesh says...

519
01:28:26.434 --> 01:28:28.434
Do you understand how it works?

520
01:28:28.434 --> 01:28:32.434
Therefore, therefore, I just spoke a bit sternly to the church.

521
01:28:32.434 --> 01:28:39.434
You need to set up a barometer every now and then and ask yourself, how much does my heart actually long for.

522
01:28:39.434 --> 01:28:43.434
If your heart is totally okay with sinning.

523
01:28:43.434 --> 01:28:47.434
If your heart is totally okay with watching porn.

524
01:28:47.434 --> 01:28:51.434
