525
01:28:51.434 --> 01:28:55.434
Oh, that's 90% of the church.

526
01:28:56.434 --> 01:28:58.434
But that's how it works.

527
01:29:00.434 --> 01:29:05.434
If your heart aches at the desire to go back.

528
01:29:05.434 --> 01:29:10.434
Then your heart is pointing that way, while your flesh wants to go this way.

529
01:29:10.434 --> 01:29:14.434
And if your flesh is stronger, and we are dealing with an addiction.

530
01:29:14.434 --> 01:29:19.434
You have to cry out in your heart, I want to be free from this, I want to be free from this.

531
01:29:19.434 --> 01:29:25.434
I want to be free from this so that you run to the church to be helped by your brothers and sisters.

532
01:29:25.434 --> 01:29:29.434
So that you ultimately do not keep falling back into that old vomit.

533
01:29:29.434 --> 01:29:35.434
For a dog certainly does not return to its own vomit, says the Bible.

534
01:29:35.434 --> 01:29:40.434
And so now I was talking about pornography, but it goes on.

535
01:29:40.434 --> 01:29:45.434
If you think you are the greatest person on earth, go to Jesus, for He is greater.

536
01:29:45.434 --> 01:29:52.434
If you are stuck in your career and it is affecting your marriage and your children, go to Jesus, for He is the Lord over your finances.

537
01:29:52.434 --> 01:29:54.434
And so it goes on.

538
01:29:54.434 --> 01:30:02.434
But Paul says in the letter to the Romans, if we are totally okay with our sins, you are probably just not saved.

539
01:30:02.434 --> 01:30:07.434
And that is what I want to tackle in this teaching at Open Church.

540
01:30:07.434 --> 01:30:14.434
I want to tackle at Open Church that yes, through the blood of Jesus, you are washed clean, but you have to want it.

541
01:30:14.434 --> 01:30:17.434
If you simply don't want it, then it just isn't.

542
01:30:17.434 --> 01:30:21.434
At least, that's not Tim, but this is what I read here.

543
01:30:21.434 --> 01:30:23.434
You must want Him, amen?

544
01:30:23.434 --> 01:30:26.434
Is there anyone in the room who wants Jesus?

545
01:30:26.434 --> 01:30:28.434
You better say yes.

546
01:30:31.434 --> 01:30:35.434
Verse 22b, through this you can truly love the brothers and sisters.

547
01:30:35.434 --> 01:30:39.434
Then always love each other with your whole heart. Good test.

548
01:30:39.434 --> 01:30:43.434
Not only love yourself, but learn to love each other.

549
01:30:43.434 --> 01:30:46.434
For you have been born again, sanctification.

550
01:30:46.434 --> 01:30:50.434
Not from mortal human parents, but from God Himself.

551
01:30:50.434 --> 01:30:53.434
Through the living and eternal Word of God.

552
01:30:53.434 --> 01:30:56.434
For in the books it says, people are like grass.

553
01:30:56.434 --> 01:30:59.434
And their beauty is like a flower in the field.

554
01:30:59.434 --> 01:31:03.434
