You should give that verse to your wife on Valentine's, that's nice.

557
01:31:10.434 --> 01:31:13.434
But the word of the Lord endures forever.

558
01:31:13.434 --> 01:31:17.434
I repeat, the word of the Lord endures forever.

559
01:31:17.434 --> 01:31:20.434
I repeat, the word of the Lord endures forever.

560
01:31:20.434 --> 01:31:25.434
Why do I keep saying this? Man, man, man, this world shakes up and down.

561
01:31:25.434 --> 01:31:29.434
Wow, man. What they found very important 20 years ago.

