01:31:34.434 --> 01:31:37.434
And it is getting faster and crazier.

565
01:31:37.434 --> 01:31:38.434
Right?

566
01:31:38.434 --> 01:31:43.434
But the living Word of God remains forever.

567
01:31:43.434 --> 01:31:46.434
That is why we base our lives on the rock.

568
01:31:46.434 --> 01:31:47.434
Amen.

569
01:31:47.434 --> 01:31:50.434
And that Word is the good news that you have heard.

570
01:31:50.434 --> 01:31:55.434
Just quickly the next 12 verses that belong to Consecration.

571
01:31:55.434 --> 01:31:58.434
